{title: Rukh}
{artist: Akhil}
{key: Cm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Cm]Tu rukh jehi [G#]jaapdi,        [A#]Main taahni wangu naal [Cm]rahaan
[Cm]Tu sukh jehi [G#]jaapdi,        Ki apna main haal [Cm]kahaan
[Cm]Akhaan ch [A#]tu ik meri,        [G#]Lakhan ch [A#]na rakh [Cm]mainu
[Cm]Kakhan ch [A#],        [Cm]aaja [A#]tu meri [G#]gali [A#]
[A#]Rabb tainu [Cm]manneya ae,        [A#]Tere layi paak main [G#]haan
[G#]Tere layi haan jeonda [A#]main,        [Cm]Tere layi khakh main [A#]haan
[A#]Tu rukh jehi [G#]jaapdi,        [A#]Main tani wangu naal [Cm]rahaan
[Cm]Tu sukh jehi [A#]jaapdi,        [G#]Ki apna main haal [A#]kahaan? [Cm]
[Cm]Mili na je tu mainu,        [Gm]Taan main mar jaana ae
[G#]Jitt de hoye vi sab kujh,        [A#]Main taa haar jaana ae
[Cm]Ki dassan tainu main,        [G#]Kinna main chaunda haan
[Cm]Tere layi [A#]bas tere layi,        [A#]Tere layi [Cm]jeyonda haan
[Cm]Tu hove na [G#]khafa methon,        [A#]Khush rakhaan tainu pyar [Cm]karaan
[Cm]Har gal vich haan [G#]hove,        [A#]Na tainu inkaar [Cm]karaan
[Cm]Tu rukh jehi [G#]jaapdi,        [A#]Main tani wangu naal [Cm]rahaan
[Cm]Tu sukh jehi [G#]jaapdi,        [A#]Ki apna main haal [Cm]kahaan?
[Cm]Tere na? duniya meri,        [A#]Tu hi mera Rabb ae
[G#]Tere na? saah chalde ne,        [A#]Tu hi mera sab ae
[Cm]Tere bagair taan yaara,        [G#]Mitti hi [A#]hovaan main
[Cm]Mar jaavan osse than te,        [A#]Je tainu khovan main
[Cm]Dil kadd mera [G#]vekh laa,        [A#]Ohde utte tera naam [Cm]hi aan
[Cm]Tere naa? [G#]wajood mera,        [A#]Unjh main taan [Cm]aam hi aan
[Cm]Tu rukh jehi [G#]jaapdi,        [A#]Main tani wangu naal [Cm]rahaan
